\b Printly Print Agent\b0\par
\par
Copyright \'a9 Printly. All rights reserved.\par
\par
This software is for use by Printly partner print shops. It connects this computer to the Printly service and sends paid customer orders to the printers attached to it.\par
\par
\b What it installs\b0\par
The application and a self-contained .NET runtime, under Program Files. It is set to start when Windows starts, because an agent that is not running prints nothing and gives no sign of it. You can turn that off later from Task Manager's Startup tab.\par
\par
\b What it stores\b0\par
Its database and logs go under your local application data folder. Sign-in credentials are held in Windows Credential Manager, not in a file. Documents downloaded for printing are deleted once printed, and any left behind are removed when the agent shuts down.\par
\par
\b What it does on this machine\b0\par
It reads the printers installed on this computer and their status, and submits print jobs to them. It does not change printer settings or install drivers.\par
\par
By installing, you agree that this computer may print orders placed through the Printly service on behalf of your shop.\par
